WEBVTT

01:31.000 --> 01:32.920
YUEBUHUAN

01:33.000 --> 01:34.520
A single tree cannot make a forest.

01:34.600 --> 01:36.640
Today, our ability to resume silk washing

01:36.720 --> 01:38.600
is due to the efforts of everyone here.

01:38.680 --> 01:40.320
I toast to all of you. Cheers!

01:48.600 --> 01:50.000
But this is only the first step.

01:50.600 --> 01:52.920
While we now have a place to wash silk,

01:53.000 --> 01:55.840
we have undoubtedly lost Mrs. Hua's order.

01:55.920 --> 01:58.040
And with her influence,

01:58.120 --> 02:00.240
the other dyehouses will likely avoid
giving us any business.

02:00.320 --> 02:02.640
In this situation,
we have no choice but to save ourselves.

02:03.440 --> 02:06.000
Thus, I propose that we, as Silk Society,

02:06.080 --> 02:07.760
participate in Splendor Showcase.

02:08.360 --> 02:10.039
If we can make a name
for ourselves in the competition,

02:10.120 --> 02:12.360
we will be able to trade
directly with the brocade merchants.

02:12.440 --> 02:15.320
Orders will no longer be a concern.

02:15.400 --> 02:16.320
What do all of you think?

02:18.360 --> 02:22.320
Truthfully, this collaboration
has benefited us greatly.

02:22.400 --> 02:25.400
However, we have also
come dangerously close to ruin.

02:26.160 --> 02:29.560
I fear our family can no longer endure.

02:30.960 --> 02:31.920
Moreover,

02:32.760 --> 02:34.720
Mrs. Hua has promised us.

02:35.520 --> 02:37.240
If we withdraw from Silk Society,

02:37.920 --> 02:39.040
she promises to let bygones be bygones.

02:40.000 --> 02:40.880
I apologize.

02:40.960 --> 02:42.880
We are left with no choice.

02:43.560 --> 02:46.440
We cannot afford to risk it,
nor do we dare to.

02:47.640 --> 02:50.000
Have you forgotten
how they bullied us in the past?

02:50.080 --> 02:52.640
Now that we have a chance,
you want to turn back?

02:56.520 --> 02:58.680
Indeed, we face a precarious situation.

02:59.720 --> 03:00.600
Everyone,

03:01.720 --> 03:03.720
we have our own path to follow.
I will not force anyone.

03:04.640 --> 03:06.440
However, if someday, you change your minds

03:06.520 --> 03:07.880
and wish to return,

03:08.680 --> 03:10.280
know that I, Ji Yingying,
will welcome you with open arms.

03:14.000 --> 03:14.920
- I apologize.
- I apologize.

03:29.320 --> 03:31.720
My mother says this matter
is indeed dangerous.

03:31.800 --> 03:33.720
However, without trust,
one has no foundation.

03:34.360 --> 03:37.440
I may not be eloquent or clever,

03:37.520 --> 03:38.760
but I do pride myself on my loyalty.

03:39.520 --> 03:41.000
Since I gave you my word,

03:41.680 --> 03:42.560
I will not go back on it.

03:43.360 --> 03:45.920
I have poor health,
so I will toast with tea instead of wine.

03:46.000 --> 03:47.040
Here's to you.

03:51.600 --> 03:53.600
That is the first time I have heard
you speak with such conviction.

03:54.240 --> 03:55.880
Ji Yingying,
I have placed my faith in you.

03:55.960 --> 03:59.760
I believe you can lead us
to something great.

04:00.760 --> 04:03.160
Something truly great. Here's to you!

04:07.480 --> 04:08.720
Yingying,

04:09.240 --> 04:10.840
I cannot make decisions for my family,

04:11.360 --> 04:13.720
but can I join you in my own name?

04:13.800 --> 04:16.279
Even if I am not much help,

04:16.360 --> 04:18.480
I will do my best whenever I am needed!

04:19.720 --> 04:20.560
Good!

04:20.640 --> 04:23.240
Then, let's earn money together
and weather this storm as one.

04:23.320 --> 04:24.920
- Agreed!
- Agreed!

04:25.640 --> 04:26.920
- Drink up!
- Cheers!

04:27.720 --> 04:28.680
A toast to everyone here!

04:29.560 --> 04:30.400
Drink up!

04:30.480 --> 04:31.520
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

04:38.360 --> 04:40.880
I have perused all the information
the guards have recorded.

04:41.680 --> 04:43.080
It seems Mr. Shen

04:43.760 --> 04:45.880
has a peculiar interest
in Mount Qingcheng.

04:45.960 --> 04:48.040
He usually frequents the mountain alone.

04:48.120 --> 04:49.760
Mount Qingcheng?

04:52.240 --> 04:54.000
Have the shadow guards
been stationed there yet?

04:54.520 --> 04:55.480
Yes, they have.

04:55.560 --> 04:57.200
Each one
is a top-tier martial arts expert.

04:57.840 --> 05:01.960
Send them to scout
the mountain thoroughly.

05:02.040 --> 05:03.560
If they detect anything unusual,
they are to report back to me immediately.

05:04.880 --> 05:06.120
Yes.

05:09.240 --> 05:11.400
Mr. Yang, a messenger from
the Yang residence came with word for you.

05:11.480 --> 05:12.480
They said that when you are
not occupied in the next few days,

05:12.560 --> 05:13.400
you should return home for a visit.

05:14.000 --> 05:15.360
Who brought the message?

05:17.720 --> 05:20.120
Was it Yang Jingshan or Yang Jinglin?

05:20.200 --> 05:22.480
Judging by their attire,
it seemed to be a servant.

05:24.160 --> 05:25.200
A servant?

05:29.000 --> 05:30.000
Yes, sir.

05:42.920 --> 05:44.760
Lei Zu Festival
will be held in a few days.

05:44.840 --> 05:47.360
Brocade Master and the brocade officer
must offer prayers together.

05:47.440 --> 05:48.880
You will not be able to avoid it.

05:52.400 --> 05:53.480
If you ask me,

05:54.920 --> 05:56.280
you might as well return now
and smooth things over.

06:01.760 --> 06:03.040
By the way, Yingying,

06:03.120 --> 06:05.440
you mentioned
participating in Splendor Showcase.

06:05.520 --> 06:07.960
But to do so,

06:08.040 --> 06:10.160
we will need a recommendation
from a top figure in the trade.

06:10.240 --> 06:12.960
Moreover, there is a hefty entry fee.

06:13.480 --> 06:17.080
We cannot manage to have either of these.

06:17.160 --> 06:19.840
I will figure out the money.

06:21.120 --> 06:22.960
- Yaoting…
- Did we not agree?

06:23.040 --> 06:25.000
You will handle the living matters,
and I will handle the dead.

06:25.080 --> 06:27.320
This money issue surely
does not count as living, does it?

06:29.840 --> 06:30.960
All right.

06:31.040 --> 06:32.360
Then, I will find someone
to advocate for us.

06:32.880 --> 06:34.040
What should we do in the meantime?

06:34.120 --> 06:37.400
I will need all of you
to dye the best silk you can produce.

06:37.480 --> 06:39.640
That will be our confidence
to compete in Splendor Showcase.

06:39.720 --> 06:41.480
- All right! Not a problem!
- Not a problem!

06:41.560 --> 06:43.080
Today, we will not stop
until we are drunk!

06:43.160 --> 06:45.040
- Agreed! Let's keep drinking!
- Keep drinking!

06:58.560 --> 07:02.360
Master, the silk is fully prepared.

07:02.440 --> 07:05.720
I have personally handpicked
the men chosen to deliver it.

07:05.800 --> 07:08.680
Now, we are only waiting
for Lei Zu Festival to begin.

07:09.360 --> 07:12.320
I guarantee nothing will go wrong. But…

07:13.240 --> 07:14.120
But what?

07:16.400 --> 07:18.680
But recently,

07:18.760 --> 07:21.520
that young lady from the Ji family
has become particularly arrogant.

07:21.600 --> 07:24.040
Not only has she sought
the support of Mr. Sang,

07:24.120 --> 07:26.480
but she is also close
to the newly appointed brocade officer.

07:27.120 --> 07:29.120
Before she had all these connections,

07:29.200 --> 07:30.200
did you manage to control her?

07:31.640 --> 07:32.880
I do not need excuses.

07:33.520 --> 07:37.200
What I want is Shu Red Silk.

07:37.960 --> 07:40.920
But Ji Yingying is cunning
and unpredictable.

07:41.000 --> 07:42.120
She is difficult to pin down.

07:43.400 --> 07:46.160
What if she truly manages
to pay off all her debts

07:46.240 --> 07:47.920
within the month?

07:48.000 --> 07:52.720
It will become much harder
to find a leverage against her.

07:52.800 --> 07:56.400
Thus, I humbly ask
for your guidance, Master.

07:56.480 --> 07:58.960
NIU WUNIANG

07:59.480 --> 08:00.680
Unpredictable as she may be,

08:01.200 --> 08:02.960
there is always
something constant around her.

08:03.040 --> 08:05.400
Counter her ever-changing moves
with steadfastness.

08:05.480 --> 08:06.560
Constant?

08:10.280 --> 08:11.600
I understand now.

08:12.120 --> 08:13.400
I appreciate your help, Master.

08:16.520 --> 08:18.160
You have two hands.

08:18.240 --> 08:22.040
Keep one on Shu Red Silk
and the other on Lei Zu Festival.

08:27.800 --> 08:29.320
Fail at either,

08:29.400 --> 08:31.360
and I will chop off that particular hand.

08:36.280 --> 08:37.360
I understand.

08:43.240 --> 08:47.040
Mr. Ji, your willingness to weave brocade
in our humble workshop

08:47.120 --> 08:50.520
is truly an honor for us.

08:50.600 --> 08:52.160
You flatter me, sir.

08:52.240 --> 08:54.480
I should be thanking you
for your generosity.

08:54.560 --> 08:57.720
The son of Brocade Master
is certainly worth the price.

08:59.120 --> 09:00.440
Here's your loom.

09:01.440 --> 09:03.720
I will not disturb you further.

09:03.800 --> 09:05.600
I will await your masterpiece.

09:06.400 --> 09:07.480
I will do my utmost.

09:15.040 --> 09:17.480
Hasn't Mr. Ji always dismissed
our little workshop as producing

09:17.560 --> 09:18.760
rough and inferior brocade?

09:19.760 --> 09:22.120
Why did he lower himself to work here now?

09:22.200 --> 09:24.280
It is because his sister offended someone.

09:24.960 --> 09:26.560
Their silk dyeing business has collapsed,

09:27.160 --> 09:28.800
and now, the family
cannot even afford food.

09:29.520 --> 09:32.240
Those major dyehouses
only employ their own people.

09:32.320 --> 09:34.400
Who would hire the son of a disgraced man?

09:47.280 --> 09:54.240
THE YU RESIDENCE

09:59.600 --> 10:01.920
THE JI RESIDENCE

10:18.480 --> 10:21.320
THE YU RESIDENCE

11:35.560 --> 11:36.840
Big rat, big rat…

11:36.920 --> 11:37.760
EXCERPTS FROM BIG RAT FROM SHIJING
GUOFENG, WEIFENG

11:37.840 --> 11:38.840
…do not eat my millet.

11:40.240 --> 11:43.560
A big rat may not steal grain
but seeks to steal a master's craft.

11:43.640 --> 11:44.960
Master Ji, will you teach me?

11:45.040 --> 11:45.920
Absolutely not!

11:46.000 --> 11:47.200
FROSTED GLIMMER, PURE LIGHT

11:47.280 --> 11:50.280
The Ji family's weaving techniques
are never taught to outsiders.

11:51.200 --> 11:53.280
‪Zhizhi. Please, Father.

11:54.640 --> 11:57.480
No idlers allowed.
It is a rule of Ji's Brocade Workshop.

11:57.560 --> 12:00.400
Who says I am idle? I can help!

12:00.480 --> 12:02.840
Father, isn't that right?

12:04.200 --> 12:05.040
Zhizhi.

12:06.320 --> 12:08.520
Help? You would only make things worse!

12:09.120 --> 12:10.600
- Come back with me at once!
- No!

12:10.680 --> 12:12.200
Father, help me!

12:12.280 --> 12:14.080
Yingying, do not be afraid. I am here.

12:16.840 --> 12:17.680
Hurry up and come with me.

12:17.760 --> 12:19.120
- Hurry up!
- Mother, easy!

12:19.200 --> 12:20.040
Mother, my ear!

12:20.120 --> 12:21.200
- How many times must I remind you?
- Mother!

12:21.280 --> 12:22.320
Do not wander into
the workshop for no reason!

12:22.400 --> 12:23.680
Ji's Brocade Workshop
strictly forbids noise

12:23.760 --> 12:24.960
and running around.

12:25.040 --> 12:26.200
Ms. Ji?

12:26.280 --> 12:28.480
Ms. Ji, this way, please.

12:34.160 --> 12:36.360
It is not that our family
fears offending others.

12:36.440 --> 12:37.280
YU SHU

12:37.360 --> 12:40.080
But to be a referrer,

12:40.160 --> 12:44.160
one must submit a substantial
security fee to the authorities.

12:45.400 --> 12:47.200
I know you are bold enough
to speak your mind

12:47.280 --> 12:48.480
and unafraid of power.

12:48.560 --> 12:50.000
It is precisely because of this
that I dared to come ask for your help.

12:51.320 --> 12:52.920
Though we are small dyehouses,

12:53.000 --> 12:54.120
we are honest people.

12:54.880 --> 12:56.440
We would never provoke trouble
without cause.

12:59.040 --> 13:01.200
These threads were all dyed by us.

13:07.200 --> 13:09.000
Take a look. Do you think they can sell?

13:17.720 --> 13:18.840
Good silk, indeed.

13:20.880 --> 13:21.720
However,

13:21.800 --> 13:26.000
good silk
does not always fetch a good price.

13:30.600 --> 13:31.720
I understand.

13:33.000 --> 13:35.440
Those who weave brocade
know the value of fine silk,

13:35.520 --> 13:37.280
but the patrons often do not.

13:37.360 --> 13:39.560
What they want is silk
with a prestigious name

13:39.640 --> 13:41.400
and a reputation
that adds to their status.

13:41.480 --> 13:43.040
That is precisely why I aim
to participate in Splendor Showcase

13:43.120 --> 13:44.480
and win the title.

13:45.720 --> 13:47.560
Even fine wine
struggles to sell in an obscure alley.

13:47.640 --> 13:50.160
I hope you may lend me
a helping hand, Mr. Yu.

13:57.800 --> 14:00.880
My family is already burdened with debt.

14:01.400 --> 14:04.400
All I have left by my side
is my granddaughter.

14:05.880 --> 14:08.000
The Yu family's century-old business

14:08.080 --> 14:09.680
has long lacked successors.

14:10.920 --> 14:12.880
I want to support you.

14:12.960 --> 14:15.200
But I cannot do anything on my own.

14:16.200 --> 14:18.920
This is not an excuse.

14:19.000 --> 14:20.280
- But I…
- I believe you.

14:21.280 --> 14:23.000
You could have refused me outright,

14:23.080 --> 14:25.120
yet you chose to share
your difficulties openly.

14:25.200 --> 14:26.920
That honesty means a great deal to me.

14:27.520 --> 14:28.360
Thank you.

14:29.880 --> 14:32.040
I will not trouble you further.
I will seek help elsewhere.

14:39.720 --> 14:41.360
Mr. Yu, farewell.

14:44.520 --> 14:47.280
To fight.
Against the heavens! Against the winds!

14:57.720 --> 15:00.240
Xi is a bit naive by nature

15:00.320 --> 15:02.120
and lacks an understanding
of worldly matters.

15:02.200 --> 15:03.480
However,

15:03.560 --> 15:05.880
she has an extraordinary ability
to sense people's hearts

15:05.960 --> 15:07.200
and emotions.

15:07.280 --> 15:09.920
She saw the fighting spirit within you.

15:10.000 --> 15:13.960
That is why she gave you the doucai ball.

15:19.560 --> 15:20.520
Join us!

15:30.800 --> 15:32.240
Who says the Yu family has no fighter?

15:32.320 --> 15:33.880
You played better than I do.

15:33.960 --> 15:36.040
I hope we can continue
doing business together in the future.

15:36.920 --> 15:37.840
Okay.

15:43.040 --> 15:45.280
Perhaps I still can play for a few years.

15:53.160 --> 15:55.760
- Ms. Ji, have a safe journey.
- Thank you.

16:00.480 --> 16:01.520
Why are you here?

16:02.160 --> 16:03.640
I heard that Ms. Ji
from Silk Society is looking

16:03.720 --> 16:05.080
for a referrer.

16:05.160 --> 16:06.160
I came to take a look.

16:08.920 --> 16:11.520
The major dyehouses in the city,
along with Mrs. Hua,

16:11.600 --> 16:14.240
have banded together
to suppress Silk Society.

16:14.320 --> 16:17.280
The brocade merchants
look down on our small workshops.

16:17.800 --> 16:21.080
Mr. Yu is kindhearted,
but even he cannot help us.

16:21.160 --> 16:22.200
THE YU RESIDENCE

16:22.280 --> 16:24.480
Have your forgotten my surname?

16:26.640 --> 16:29.440
The referrer must be a patriarch

16:29.520 --> 16:32.040
and must provide
a substantial deposit as collateral.

16:32.120 --> 16:33.840
Even you,
the second son of the Zhao family,

16:33.920 --> 16:35.680
cannot help me this time.

16:35.760 --> 16:38.240
Who said I meant myself?
I was talking about my grandfather.

16:40.520 --> 16:42.640
He has never liked us
hanging out together.

16:42.720 --> 16:44.200
Why would he agree to help now?

16:45.160 --> 16:46.960
I showed him
the wind-patterned silk handkerchief

16:47.040 --> 16:48.200
you gave me.

16:48.280 --> 16:50.560
He kept it
and said he is willing to meet you.

16:51.320 --> 16:52.960
- Then, what are we waiting for?
- Let's go.

16:53.040 --> 16:55.760
THE ZHAO RESIDENCE

17:39.440 --> 17:41.880
Grandfather, Mother.

17:45.760 --> 17:47.160
Greetings, Mr. Zhao Senior.

17:48.360 --> 17:49.840
Please, rise.

17:49.920 --> 17:52.000
MR. ZHAO SENIOR

17:53.240 --> 17:54.280
Mrs. Zhao.

17:57.360 --> 17:59.960
Xiuyuan, what are you standing there for?

18:00.040 --> 18:01.240
Come sit beside me.

18:03.760 --> 18:04.840
That's all right, Mother.

18:04.920 --> 18:06.400
I'll stand here.

18:09.240 --> 18:13.800
An unmarried woman
spending her days out in public

18:14.640 --> 18:17.960
and now meddling in Silk Society,
engaging in business meant for men.

18:18.880 --> 18:20.880
- This is…
- Mother!

18:22.720 --> 18:24.840
Mrs. Zhao, I believe that

18:24.920 --> 18:26.920
business is not merely
the exchange of money for goods.

18:27.440 --> 18:29.160
Even managing expenses
and hiring staff within the household

18:29.240 --> 18:30.440
are forms of business.

18:30.520 --> 18:33.240
Some even consider marriages
and child-rearing

18:33.320 --> 18:35.640
as pursuits.

18:35.720 --> 18:37.480
What nonsense!

18:37.560 --> 18:39.240
Leave at once.

18:39.920 --> 18:42.200
Your words offend our ears.
Why are you still here?

18:44.080 --> 18:46.880
Shenniang, leave at once.

18:51.080 --> 18:52.120
Yes.

19:00.040 --> 19:02.920
Xiuyuan told me
that the colors on this handkerchief

19:03.520 --> 19:05.320
were your doing?

19:05.960 --> 19:08.600
To weave a scenery is easy,
but to capture elegance is not.

19:08.680 --> 19:10.000
Blending and layering colors

19:10.080 --> 19:12.960
allow for a play of light and shadow,
creating movement,

19:13.040 --> 19:14.480
like the wind.

19:14.560 --> 19:16.680
Blending and layering are not difficult.

19:17.720 --> 19:18.560
What is rare

19:18.640 --> 19:21.960
is the keen eye to discern subtle hues

19:22.040 --> 19:25.680
and the talent to select
and create perfect colors.

19:26.880 --> 19:29.640
You remind me of your father
in this aspect.

19:32.000 --> 19:34.160
Embroidery is a matter of needles,

19:34.240 --> 19:36.440
while brocade requires a loom.

19:36.520 --> 19:39.080
The two are vastly different crafts.

19:39.160 --> 19:43.040
To transfer this design onto a loom

19:43.760 --> 19:45.480
will not be easy.

19:51.880 --> 19:53.080
I am willing to try.

19:54.560 --> 19:56.320
Very well. Give it a try.

19:57.240 --> 20:01.560
Ms. Ji, since you seek
a recommendation for the competition,

20:02.080 --> 20:04.960
I am willing to give you a chance as well.

20:06.440 --> 20:07.560
What should I do?

20:07.640 --> 20:10.040
The Zhao family
has a stockpile of aged silk.

20:10.120 --> 20:12.840
The quality is decent,

20:13.360 --> 20:15.360
but the colors are outdated.

20:15.960 --> 20:17.880
If you can manage to sell this silk

20:17.960 --> 20:22.000
within half a month, Ms. Ji,

20:22.080 --> 20:24.760
I will grant your request

20:24.840 --> 20:28.000
and recommend you to the brocade guild.

20:29.480 --> 20:31.120
Mr. Zhao Senior, rest assured.

20:31.200 --> 20:32.640
I will see to it.

20:34.880 --> 20:36.640
You have stepped into the spotlight now.

20:36.720 --> 20:38.440
You will have no chance
to hide your talent anymore.

20:39.120 --> 20:42.160
You once said that the more
Mr. Zhao Senior values someone,

20:42.680 --> 20:44.240
the less freedom they have.

20:44.320 --> 20:46.520
Everything must follow
the Zhao family's rules.

20:48.040 --> 20:50.160
But giving in once
leads to endless yielding.

20:51.280 --> 20:54.360
Instead of being compliant,
it is better to seize control.

20:55.400 --> 20:57.400
Isn't that what Sang Shisi said?

20:59.480 --> 21:00.880
Xiuyuan, I will take my leave.

21:01.920 --> 21:03.840
All right. Stay safe.

21:14.360 --> 21:15.360
YUEBUHUAN

21:15.440 --> 21:16.920
I do not believe

21:17.000 --> 21:18.840
that Mr. Zhao Senior
genuinely wants to help you.

21:19.840 --> 21:21.280
He is simply using you

21:21.360 --> 21:24.240
to lure his beloved grandson back
into weaving brocade.

21:24.320 --> 21:25.680
Selling silk?

21:25.760 --> 21:27.520
He is clearly making
things difficult on purpose.

21:28.480 --> 21:30.400
If you fail to sell it,
he will blame your incompetence.

21:30.480 --> 21:33.440
- He will not be responsible.
- Of course, he has his own motives.

21:33.520 --> 21:34.840
But he has given his word.

21:34.920 --> 21:37.800
If I succeed,
he will not be able to go back on it.

21:38.480 --> 21:40.560
Now, what I need is a good business idea.

21:51.520 --> 21:52.720
Yang Jinglan?

21:57.120 --> 21:58.320
Today

22:00.160 --> 22:01.440
is the 19th.

22:01.520 --> 22:03.080
It is his mother's death anniversary.

22:04.280 --> 22:05.320
A death anniversary?

22:06.360 --> 22:08.520
And he dresses so flamboyantly?

22:08.600 --> 22:09.440
YUEBUHUAN

22:09.520 --> 22:10.360
That is just who he is.

22:11.000 --> 22:14.240
The more sorrowful he feels,
the more outrageous his behavior becomes.

22:14.320 --> 22:15.400
How do you know that?

22:18.040 --> 22:20.840
That's right.
You used to be his sister-in-law.

22:28.760 --> 22:30.040
What trouble
have you gotten into this time?

22:30.640 --> 22:31.560
A fight.

22:31.640 --> 22:32.600
Who won?

22:32.680 --> 22:33.520
Do I ever lose?

22:35.720 --> 22:36.760
Why are you here?

22:39.600 --> 22:40.680
I argued with the elders.

22:40.760 --> 22:41.640
Who won?

22:41.720 --> 22:42.960
What do you think?

22:50.160 --> 22:51.080
What are you doing?

22:54.040 --> 22:55.080
These are offerings.

22:55.680 --> 22:57.040
Who cares?

22:57.120 --> 22:59.040
What is the point
of offerings to the dead?

22:59.120 --> 23:00.920
Besides, my mother is not enshrined here.

23:13.360 --> 23:15.280
I am just like him.

23:15.360 --> 23:16.880
We hate the Yang family's rules,

23:18.760 --> 23:20.080
and we tarnish their reputation.

23:24.720 --> 23:25.880
Juxian.

23:26.680 --> 23:28.160
Greetings, Juxian, my sister-in-law.

23:28.240 --> 23:30.640
YANG JUXIAN, YANG JINGLAN'S FATHER
AND THE YANG FAMILY'S MATRIARCH

23:31.240 --> 23:32.800
All of you suddenly gathered here.

23:32.880 --> 23:33.840
What is the occasion?

23:33.920 --> 23:35.480
- Had we not been summoned here?
- Yes.

23:35.560 --> 23:36.760
Who called you?

23:38.320 --> 23:39.520
No one?

23:39.600 --> 23:40.560
Perhaps there has been a misunderstanding.

23:52.840 --> 23:54.920
This troublemaker!

24:12.200 --> 24:14.160
Today is my mother's death anniversary.

24:15.160 --> 24:17.400
I have brought a gift to Mr. Yang Juxian.

24:18.200 --> 24:20.400
I ask everyone here to bear witness.

24:23.880 --> 24:27.440
A KIND FATHER, AND A FILIAL SON

24:31.000 --> 24:32.800
If Mr. Yang Juxian
wishes to reprimand me again,

24:32.880 --> 24:34.720
let him first reflect

24:35.640 --> 24:37.480
on these words.

24:37.560 --> 24:39.440
You…

24:39.520 --> 24:41.680
Do you want to hit me?

24:42.440 --> 24:43.960
We are no longer in the past.

24:45.040 --> 24:46.280
If you dare strike me now,

24:47.520 --> 24:50.000
it will be counted
as an assault on an imperial officer.

24:50.080 --> 24:51.280
Jinglan!

24:51.800 --> 24:54.200
Today, you have blatantly
disregarded proper decorum,

24:54.280 --> 24:56.360
mocked your elders,
and ridiculed your father!

24:56.440 --> 24:59.240
Do you have no sense of duty
as a son or nephew?

24:59.960 --> 25:01.880
Uncle, you are the one
who knows the rules best.

25:01.960 --> 25:03.120
Thus, tell us.

25:04.480 --> 25:08.000
What is greater, public duty
or private matters?

25:08.080 --> 25:11.280
Which holds more weight,
the emperor's mandate or the family rules?

25:15.560 --> 25:16.960
Naturally,
the emperor's mandate is greater.

25:18.200 --> 25:20.200
Then, the Yang family's rule…?

25:25.920 --> 25:28.480
- Greetings, Mr. Yang.
- Greetings, Mr. Yang.

25:35.640 --> 25:37.840
Why does he resent
the Yang family so much?

25:37.920 --> 25:38.880
Do you want to know?

25:39.640 --> 25:41.760
Since I'll inevitably
cross paths with him,

25:41.840 --> 25:43.160
I ought to have
a good understanding of him.

25:52.360 --> 25:54.680
- Tell me.
- Why don't you first tell me

25:54.760 --> 25:55.840
about your opinion of my new wine?

25:59.760 --> 26:03.080
I drank it all too quickly,
so I did not get to savor it properly.

26:03.800 --> 26:04.800
Let me taste it again.

26:09.080 --> 26:10.280
It is fragrant!

26:15.600 --> 26:19.480
His mother was his father's greatest love.

26:21.000 --> 26:22.600
However, she came from humble origins.

26:23.640 --> 26:26.560
Back then, the Yang family business
was struggling,

26:26.640 --> 26:28.800
and the elders forced his father

26:28.880 --> 26:31.960
to marry a woman from a wealthy family
as his wife.

26:33.080 --> 26:35.040
His mother waited five long years

26:35.120 --> 26:36.840
before she was finally
married into the Yang family,

26:37.800 --> 26:39.000
but only as a concubine.

26:44.240 --> 26:45.080
- Go away!
- Jinglan!

26:45.160 --> 26:46.080
I don't want you to see my mother.

26:46.160 --> 26:47.600
Jinglan,

26:47.680 --> 26:49.760
your father rushed back overnight.

26:49.840 --> 26:51.120
Rushed back overnight?

26:51.200 --> 26:53.040
You received word
of her critical state ten days ago,

26:53.120 --> 26:54.640
yet you only arrived now.

26:54.720 --> 26:55.760
It's because
you were occupied with business

26:55.840 --> 26:57.200
and obsessed with negotiating!

27:00.560 --> 27:02.160
My mother's life

27:03.200 --> 27:04.760
never mattered to you.

27:04.840 --> 27:06.240
How dare you!

27:06.320 --> 27:08.360
The Yang family business
is of utmost importance.

27:08.440 --> 27:09.920
It naturally outweighs personal matters.

27:10.000 --> 27:11.840
As a member of the Yang family,

27:12.920 --> 27:14.520
you ought to understand this.

27:14.600 --> 27:16.920
The interests of our kin matters,

27:17.440 --> 27:19.080
but what about my mom's life?

27:19.160 --> 27:20.760
Such insolence!

27:21.280 --> 27:23.840
Sir, will you continue to indulge him?

27:23.920 --> 27:27.320
Guards, send this unfilial son
to the clan for discipline!

27:27.400 --> 27:29.040
Let go of me! I am not going!

27:29.120 --> 27:30.520
Let me go!

27:30.600 --> 27:31.880
- Release him!
- Release me!

27:31.960 --> 27:32.920
Release him!

27:34.280 --> 27:37.880
Defying your elders
and uttering such disgraceful words.

27:40.640 --> 27:42.200
- Apologize!
- I will not!

27:42.280 --> 27:43.120
Will you admit your fault?

27:43.200 --> 27:44.680
Will you…?

27:44.760 --> 27:46.640
- Jinglan, just apologize! Jinglan!
- Apologize!

27:49.560 --> 27:53.880
THE MEMORIAL TABLET OF MRS. YANG

28:08.280 --> 28:12.680
Your mother would be so happy
if she knew you had returned.

28:16.440 --> 28:18.160
Had she seen you back then,

28:20.520 --> 28:22.160
she would have been delighted.

28:25.240 --> 28:26.760
After your mother passed away,

28:26.840 --> 28:28.600
I admit

28:29.520 --> 28:31.720
I was stricter with you.

28:32.600 --> 28:34.720
However, so many years have gone by.

28:35.880 --> 28:37.080
Are you still holding a grudge?

28:42.280 --> 28:44.120
If you do not wish to discuss the past,

28:44.200 --> 28:46.080
then let's talk about the present.

28:47.600 --> 28:51.520
Being a brocade officer
is no ordinary position.

28:52.080 --> 28:54.080
- You must…
- Rest assured.

28:54.920 --> 28:56.760
I will not drag
the Yang family into anything,

28:58.320 --> 28:59.400
and I hope

29:00.880 --> 29:01.920
the family will not drag me down either.

29:05.160 --> 29:08.880
Is this the real reason
for your dramatic return?

29:11.440 --> 29:14.840
Why are you so eager
to sever ties with our family?

29:17.520 --> 29:18.600
I do not hold a grudge against you.

29:20.200 --> 29:21.320
However,

29:23.000 --> 29:25.120
I just do not want to have
anything more to do with you.

29:28.160 --> 29:30.160
Ah, so that is why!

29:30.680 --> 29:32.920
No wonder he loathes negotiating with me.

29:34.280 --> 29:35.680
It is not you he dislikes.

29:35.760 --> 29:37.160
It is the Yang family he despises.

29:37.240 --> 29:39.040
But who does not?

29:39.120 --> 29:41.280
Why should I abide
by the Yang family's rules?

29:42.760 --> 29:44.680
Is weaving brocade that impressive?

29:44.760 --> 29:46.080
I can even brew wine!

29:47.080 --> 29:48.400
People may live without wearing brocade,

29:49.200 --> 29:50.880
but no one can live without wine.

29:53.520 --> 29:55.880
You asked me to taste the wine,
but you ended up getting drunk.

30:01.280 --> 30:03.200
I should not have talked
to you about the Yang family.

30:03.960 --> 30:05.960
Where are you going? Do not leave!

30:06.040 --> 30:08.360
I am going to make you
some hangover remedy.

30:08.440 --> 30:09.480
I do not need it…!

30:09.560 --> 30:10.920
I am fine!

30:11.000 --> 30:13.680
- Wait…
- Slow down…

30:14.680 --> 30:15.800
I am fine!

30:16.840 --> 30:17.960
Slow down!

30:18.040 --> 30:20.080
- You need to stop drinking.
- Yingying!

30:21.200 --> 30:23.280
- Yaoting!
- Mr. Ji, you are here.

30:23.360 --> 30:25.440
- Ms. Yu.
- Yaoting, why are you here?

30:25.520 --> 30:26.560
I have come to take you home.

30:26.640 --> 30:28.000
Perfect timing!

30:28.080 --> 30:30.000
Come. Let us sit and have a drink.

30:31.440 --> 30:34.800
Yaoting,
go and make a hangover remedy for Yu.

30:34.880 --> 30:36.480
I need to coax her to sleep
before I can leave.

30:36.560 --> 30:38.000
- All right.
- Yingying,

30:38.080 --> 30:41.120
what do you think
I should call my new wine?

30:41.640 --> 30:43.840
What about Amber Glow?

30:43.920 --> 30:45.800
- How about it?
- The World's Best Wine!

30:47.360 --> 30:48.800
The World's Best Wine?

30:49.400 --> 30:51.400
I would not dare boast that much.

30:55.880 --> 30:56.920
Mr. Yang,

30:58.000 --> 31:00.800
the tavern is closed.
Come back another day.

31:03.200 --> 31:04.120
The door is open,

31:05.200 --> 31:06.440
and there are people here.

31:06.520 --> 31:07.480
What is this?

31:07.560 --> 31:10.320
You are allowed to drink here,
but I am not?

31:11.040 --> 31:12.680
We are taking care of someone
who has had too much.

31:15.920 --> 31:16.800
Who is drunk?

31:18.360 --> 31:19.200
I am not drunk!

31:19.280 --> 31:20.480
Not at all!

31:21.000 --> 31:22.800
Sit… Everyone, sit.

31:23.320 --> 31:24.640
I will get more wine for us.

31:33.160 --> 31:34.360
Ms. Yu?

31:36.720 --> 31:37.640
Ms. Yu!

31:38.280 --> 31:40.880
Mr. Ji, you have had too much.

31:40.960 --> 31:41.920
I…

31:43.240 --> 31:47.280
Your brother is drunk
without a sip of wine.

31:48.920 --> 31:50.080
Wait for me.

31:50.160 --> 31:52.160
I will fetch the wine. Wait for me!

31:58.520 --> 31:59.960
I am

32:01.800 --> 32:02.720
in a foul mood tonight.

32:03.440 --> 32:04.280
Let us do this.

32:05.560 --> 32:06.880
Pretend we do not know each other,

32:07.760 --> 32:09.960
forget the past,
and treat this as a chance meeting.

32:12.200 --> 32:13.760
Will you sit and share a drink with me?

32:16.760 --> 32:17.800
Very well.

32:21.920 --> 32:23.120
Mr. Yang,

32:24.080 --> 32:24.920
my sister was impulsive.

32:25.000 --> 32:26.560
How could we dare drink alongside you?

32:26.640 --> 32:28.000
We kindly ask for your forgiveness.

32:33.560 --> 32:34.440
I apologize.

32:35.440 --> 32:38.280
I spent too much time outside,
so I am unaccustomed to the city's rules.

32:39.800 --> 32:40.680
Let us do this.

32:40.760 --> 32:42.320
I will take some wine and leave.

32:46.280 --> 32:48.280
Leave?

32:49.040 --> 32:50.360
Where do you think you are going?

32:52.800 --> 32:55.240
She is an unmarried young lady,

32:55.320 --> 32:58.880
so it is improper for her to share
a drink with you at this hour.

32:59.480 --> 33:00.640
But I can do it.

33:01.160 --> 33:02.960
Who is not a wanderer at heart?

33:03.040 --> 33:04.400
Will you drink?

33:04.480 --> 33:05.520
Have a seat!

33:06.920 --> 33:08.640
We'll drink the wanderer's brew!

33:14.160 --> 33:15.200
Cheers!

33:22.800 --> 33:24.520
Do you remember

33:24.600 --> 33:25.720
the time we were punished
and made to kneel in the ancestral hall?

33:27.600 --> 33:29.000
I would rather not.

33:29.080 --> 33:30.480
It is best to forget.

33:31.360 --> 33:33.720
Not even good wine
can keep your mouth shut.

33:39.040 --> 33:39.960
Yaoting,

33:40.840 --> 33:42.120
I envy them.

33:45.600 --> 33:48.080
- Yingying…
- I know I am a woman.

33:48.800 --> 33:50.480
Living in Yizhou means
I must follow reason

33:50.560 --> 33:51.720
and obey the rules.

33:52.800 --> 33:54.720
It is not about what I want to do.

33:57.240 --> 33:59.000
Slow down.

34:07.320 --> 34:09.159
But drinking like this
will not solve anything either.

34:12.159 --> 34:13.239
Can you still drink or not?

34:15.600 --> 34:17.000
I am so happy.

34:17.080 --> 34:18.320
Here!

34:18.400 --> 34:20.679
Two pots of wine and two pots of soup.

34:20.760 --> 34:21.920
You may not sniff them, nor touch them.

34:22.000 --> 34:24.159
Pick one at random. It is all up to luck.

34:24.239 --> 34:26.719
Do you dare to… wager?

34:33.040 --> 34:33.880
Too much ginger.

34:33.960 --> 34:35.040
Not enough salt.

34:35.120 --> 34:37.000
I will fix it next time.

34:38.960 --> 34:41.320
- What are you doing?
- Who said we would stop at just one pot?

34:41.400 --> 34:43.760
The greed of man knows no bound.

34:49.880 --> 34:51.040
Why is this still
the same hangover remedy?

34:51.880 --> 34:54.120
The wisdom of the tavern owner
knows no bounds.

34:54.199 --> 34:56.400
How else could we ensure
you drink the remedy?

34:59.120 --> 35:00.400
Receptive.

35:00.480 --> 35:02.040
And crafty.

35:03.080 --> 35:04.160
A sly merchant, indeed!

35:04.240 --> 35:06.080
Crafty and re…?

35:09.400 --> 35:11.320
Receptive.

35:13.480 --> 35:14.640
Yaoting,

35:14.720 --> 35:16.920
I have thought of a way
to sell the surplus silk!

35:25.000 --> 35:26.400
I cannot do this anymore.

35:27.600 --> 35:29.600
The Zhao family's silk

35:29.680 --> 35:31.440
is beyond useless!

35:31.520 --> 35:32.600
And there is so much of it!

35:32.680 --> 35:34.480
Look at me.

35:34.560 --> 35:37.080
Are my eyelids glued shut? Take a look.

35:37.600 --> 35:38.800
All right.

35:40.600 --> 35:42.720
Snap out of it, will you?

35:42.800 --> 35:44.360
There was not much to begin with.

35:44.440 --> 35:46.280
Once we finish this, there will be…!

35:48.560 --> 35:49.840
There will only be a little left!

35:50.800 --> 35:52.680
I do not need you to fan me.

35:52.760 --> 35:54.040
Stop blocking the light, will you?

35:57.240 --> 35:59.000
All right. I will move to the side.

35:59.840 --> 36:01.080
Sang Shisi!

36:01.160 --> 36:02.840
- Oh my!
- Do not touch my silk!

36:02.920 --> 36:04.080
Stay away from her!

36:04.720 --> 36:05.600
I…

36:06.800 --> 36:09.240
- I will pick it up!
- Yingying, I finished the embroidery.

36:12.520 --> 36:13.640
As expected of you, Pin.

36:13.720 --> 36:15.280
You're quick and flawless.

36:17.040 --> 36:18.520
As expected, Mr. Ji,

36:18.600 --> 36:21.640
your weaving is perfectly balanced,
smooth, and refined.

36:21.720 --> 36:23.080
What a fine brocade!

36:24.360 --> 36:27.320
This month, I will add
ten qian to your pay.

36:28.800 --> 36:29.960
I appreciate it, Mr. Wang.

36:36.760 --> 36:39.120
Hold on. What is this?

36:39.680 --> 36:41.000
How am I supposed to sell this?

36:41.080 --> 36:42.960
You are sitting near Mr. Ji,

36:43.040 --> 36:45.040
and yet you cannot
seem to learn anything from him!

36:45.720 --> 36:47.240
Mr. Wang, I…

36:47.320 --> 36:49.360
Listen carefully, all of you.

36:49.440 --> 36:51.800
The previous order was delayed.

36:51.880 --> 36:53.840
Thus, each of you will have two qian
docked from your pay this month.

36:53.920 --> 36:56.880
In this workshop,
rewards and penalties are clear.

36:56.960 --> 36:58.080
The skilled earn more.

36:58.160 --> 37:01.080
If you improve your weaving,

37:01.680 --> 37:03.040
you will earn what you deserve.

37:21.520 --> 37:24.440
Mr. Ji, you indeed weave beautifully.

37:25.280 --> 37:27.640
We should learn from him.

37:27.720 --> 37:28.960
Indeed.

37:29.040 --> 37:30.960
Once I finish my batch, I will teach you.

37:34.000 --> 37:35.640
Showing off, are you?

37:35.720 --> 37:39.080
Before you came, Mr. Wang
never complained about our work.

37:39.840 --> 37:41.640
- You just have to stand out, don't you?
- Thank you so much!

37:48.440 --> 37:52.800
JI

37:56.480 --> 37:57.400
Father,

37:58.320 --> 38:00.280
do I lack talent for weaving brocade?

38:01.640 --> 38:03.360
Talent?

38:03.440 --> 38:05.200
I do not have much of that either.

38:05.280 --> 38:07.640
But what I rely on are these simple words.

38:08.480 --> 38:10.160
Diligence makes up for lack of talent.

38:10.240 --> 38:12.600
As long as you put
your heart into something you love,

38:12.680 --> 38:15.240
you will not only succeed,
but you will also excel.

38:20.120 --> 38:22.800
JI

38:22.880 --> 38:24.720
Seven times pulling, eight times tugging.

38:24.800 --> 38:25.800
What is this?

38:25.880 --> 38:27.920
What are you doing?

38:29.280 --> 38:30.720
If you are here to stir up trouble again,

38:30.800 --> 38:32.920
do not bother coming to work
at the Wang family's shop!

38:33.000 --> 38:34.560
Go! Get back to work now!

38:34.640 --> 38:36.400
You are unbelievable!

38:41.320 --> 38:43.200
Mr. Ji, come here.

38:43.960 --> 38:46.200
Mr. Ji, are you all right?

38:49.280 --> 38:50.760
I am all right.

38:50.840 --> 38:53.520
Mr. Wang, may I purchase this loom?

38:54.320 --> 38:55.880
It is the one my father
used many years ago,

38:56.720 --> 38:58.520
and I would like to have it as a keepsake.

38:58.600 --> 39:00.880
This loom may be broken,

39:01.400 --> 39:02.600
but it is not cheap.

39:02.680 --> 39:04.720
I will gather the money.

39:04.800 --> 39:06.560
Please, grant me this request, Mr. Wang.

39:16.840 --> 39:18.280
Lei Zu Festival

39:18.840 --> 39:22.600
Don floral garments
Cross the long embankment

39:23.480 --> 39:24.840
And bow deeply

39:24.920 --> 39:26.960
- Slow down! Watch your step!
- Seek excellence

39:37.080 --> 39:38.280
Where is Mr. Yang?

39:38.880 --> 39:40.760
The appointed hour is almost upon us.

39:40.840 --> 39:42.560
Missing the appointed time
is a grave offense.

39:42.640 --> 39:44.360
If he is late, it is either deliberate

39:44.440 --> 39:46.040
or he has prepared an excuse.

39:46.600 --> 39:47.520
You seem to know him well.

39:48.720 --> 39:50.520
Know your enemy,
and you will never lose a battle.

39:52.760 --> 39:54.000
Where is Mr. Sang?

39:54.520 --> 39:56.520
I sent him to hire porters
for the ceremony work.

39:56.600 --> 39:59.560
Everyone has their role,
and he needs to do something.

40:01.680 --> 40:03.920
Mr. Zhao is here! He is looking at you.

40:32.440 --> 40:34.520
Mrs. Yang, what a blessing you have.

40:35.840 --> 40:37.800
Your eldest son remains Brocade Master,

40:37.880 --> 40:39.920
and your third son has become
the brocade officer.

40:40.000 --> 40:41.320
To have a pair
of outstanding talents in one family

40:41.840 --> 40:43.560
is truly an object of envy.

40:45.360 --> 40:47.160
The two sons of the Zhao family

40:47.240 --> 40:50.000
are equally remarkable.

40:50.080 --> 40:53.120
Mr. Zhao Senior,
you must feel blessed as well.

40:53.200 --> 40:56.760
We, the ordinary folk, cannot compare.

40:57.520 --> 40:59.880
Your eldest son will compete
in the Brocade Weaving Competition,

40:59.960 --> 41:01.680
while your third son will judge.

41:01.760 --> 41:03.240
The Yang family stands unrivaled

41:03.320 --> 41:05.920
in Yizhou's brocade industry.

41:08.120 --> 41:09.840
My eldest son's Brocade Master title

41:10.360 --> 41:13.080
comes from the recognition
of Shu's artisans.

41:13.160 --> 41:15.000
My third son's appointment
as brocade officer

41:15.080 --> 41:17.200
is an honor from the imperial court.

41:17.280 --> 41:19.440
The Yang family owes its success today

41:19.520 --> 41:22.880
to your support
and the fairness of the court.

41:22.960 --> 41:24.320
Therefore,

41:24.400 --> 41:26.560
be it my eldest or my third,

41:26.640 --> 41:29.800
they will always win hearts with reason
and act with fairness and integrity.

41:29.880 --> 41:31.320
What do you think?

41:31.400 --> 41:33.600
Naturally, the matter of right and wrong

41:33.680 --> 41:36.640
is plain for all to see.

41:38.560 --> 41:42.560
If you two have the time to argue,

41:43.080 --> 41:45.400
perhaps you should
send someone to look for him.

41:45.480 --> 41:48.240
The appointed hour is approaching quickly.

41:48.760 --> 41:51.240
If we anger Lei Zu,

41:51.320 --> 41:53.320
no one will beget good fortune.

41:53.400 --> 41:55.760
The brocade officer has arrived!

42:13.280 --> 42:14.600
The first incense offering
is an important occasion.

42:14.680 --> 42:15.720
Why are you late?

42:15.800 --> 42:18.480
Missing the appointed hour
is a grave disrespect to Lei Zu!

42:19.240 --> 42:20.440
Is this how

42:20.520 --> 42:22.560
the Yang family
addresses an officer of my stature?

42:24.080 --> 42:26.320
Is it me who disrespects Lei Zu,

42:26.400 --> 42:28.160
or is it you who disrespects me?

42:28.240 --> 42:29.600
The auspicious hour has arrived!

42:29.680 --> 42:31.840
All must remain solemn and reverent.

42:31.920 --> 42:34.720
People, bring the basin and cloth.

42:34.800 --> 42:38.200
Brocade officer, Brocade Master,
wash your hands and calm your mind.

42:50.000 --> 42:51.080
This one!

42:52.080 --> 42:55.040
Miss, someone asked me
to deliver this to you.

42:55.120 --> 42:56.120
Thank you.

42:57.440 --> 43:00.480
If you do not want your brother jailed,
return home immediately.
